[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14820.389, "timestamp": "04:07:00", "text": "我给Vic和Fuji都弄了一份，因为我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14824.71, "timestamp": "04:07:04", "text": "维克给自己买了这笔钱。是的，我也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14826.87, "timestamp": "04:07:06", "text": "是的，它一直在蔓延。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14829.99, "timestamp": "04:07:09", "text": "我们刚才一直在玩。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14832.71, "timestamp": "04:07:12", "text": "我下载了游戏。好的。的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14834.469, "timestamp": "04:07:14", "text": "我刚下载完游戏，就没人点赞了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14839.269, "timestamp": "04:07:19", "text": "所有人都停了下来。我不知道为什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14842.07, "timestamp": "04:07:22", "text": "是的。我只是个迫近的、迫近的、像……一样的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14844.95, "timestamp": "04:07:24", "text": "笼罩着一层不信任的阴云。随便吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14847.269, "timestamp": "04:07:27", "text": "一碰就灭亡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14849.51, "timestamp": "04:07:29", "text": "我的天啊。不，别这么说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14852.15, "timestamp": "04:07:32", "text": "我的天啊。总之，我显然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14854.469, "timestamp": "04:07:34", "text": "开玩笑的。 J先生，您能进入吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14856.99, "timestamp": "04:07:36", "text": "游戏？是的，我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14859.75, "timestamp": "04:07:39", "text": "之前有可用的回收物。所以，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14862.07, "timestamp": "04:07:42", "text": "就像重新开始，不再欺骗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14864.55, "timestamp": "04:07:44", "text": "是的，这是我第一次上网。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14866.87, "timestamp": "04:07:46", "text": "在《Valerant》中待了很久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14871.03, "timestamp": "04:07:51", "text": "Ch先生是的，即使好吧，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14874.79, "timestamp": "04:07:54", "text": "看到先生像他希望的那样离开，他不想玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14877.11, "timestamp": "04:07:57", "text": "游戏中可能只有两轮或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14879.99, "timestamp": "04:07:59", "text": "即使这样，他仍然排在前五名。"}]